{"id":"sidonians","en":"Sidonians","ru":"Сидоняне","lines":[{"l":1,"t":"Descended from Sidon, son of Canaan","r":["GEN 10:15","1CH 1:13"]},{"l":1,"t":"Formerly a part of the Phoenician nation","r":["MAT 15:21","MAT 15:22","MRK 7:24","MRK 7:26"]},{"l":1,"t":"Dwelt on the sea coast","r":["LUK 6:17","ACT 27:3"]},{"l":1,"t":"Cities of mentioned","r":[]},{"l":2,"t":"Zidon","r":["JOS 11:8","JOS 19:28"]},{"l":2,"t":"Zarephath or Sarepta","r":["1KI 17:9","LUK 4:26"]},{"l":2,"t":"Governed by kings","r":["JER 25:22","JER 27:3"]},{"l":1,"t":"Character of","r":[]},{"l":2,"t":"Careless and secure","r":["JDG 18:7"]},{"l":2,"t":"Idolatrous","r":["1KI 11:5"]},{"l":2,"t":"Superstitious","r":["JER 27:3","JER 27:9"]},{"l":2,"t":"Wicked and impenitent","r":["MAT 11:21","MAT 11:22"]},{"l":1,"t":"Engaged in extensive commerce","r":["ISA 23:2"]},{"l":1,"t":"Were skilful sailors","r":["EZK 27:8"]},{"l":1,"t":"Supplied the Jews with timber","r":["1CH 22:4","EZR 3:7"]},{"l":1,"t":"Supplied from Judea with provisions","r":["ACT 12:20","EZK 27:17"]},{"l":1,"t":"Territory of","r":[]},{"l":2,"t":"Bordered on the land of Canaan","r":["GEN 10:19"]},{"l":2,"t":"Given by God to Israel","r":["GEN 49:13","JOS 13:6"]},{"l":2,"t":"Allotted to the tribe of Asher","r":["JOS 19:24","JOS 19:28"]},{"l":2,"t":"Visited by our Lord","r":["MAT 15:21"]},{"l":1,"t":"Israel unable to expel","r":["JDG 1:31","JDG 3:3"]},{"l":1,"t":"Hostile and oppressive to God’s people","r":["JDG 10:12","EZK 28:22","EZK 28:24","JOL 3:5","JOL 3:6"]},{"l":1,"t":"Solomon intermarried with","r":["1KI 11:1"]},{"l":1,"t":"Ahab intermarried with","r":["1KI 16:31"]},{"l":1,"t":"Israel followed the idolatry of","r":["JDG 10:6","1KI 11:33"]},{"l":1,"t":"Predictions respecting","r":[]},{"l":2,"t":"Territory of, to be given to Nebuchadnezzar, king of Babylon","r":["JER 27:3","JER 27:6"]},{"l":2,"t":"Partaking with the other nations of God’s judgments","r":["JER 25:22-28","EZK 32:20"]},{"l":2,"t":"All their helpers to be cut off","r":["JER 47:4"